flowchart TD
  B([From part 1]) --> OS[Crew ON_SCENE<br/>reads Medical Card]
  OS --> VS[Record vital signs<br/>administer first aid]
  VS --> TN{Transport<br/>needed?}
  TN -- no --> NT[NO_TRANSPORT<br/>ambulance AVAILABLE]
  TN -- yes --> TR[TRANSPORTING<br/>to selected hospital]
  TR --> HO[AT_HOSPITAL<br/>hand over, record locked]
  HO --> DOC[Doctor reads Medical Card,<br/>treats patient, diagnosis]
  DOC --> FIN[Finalize case<br/>Medical History updated]
  NT & FIN --> CL[Dispatcher closes incident<br/>resources released]
  CL --> E([End])
